flowchart TD
  A[Entry surface] --> B[Review primary content]
  B --> C{Input required?}
  C -- No --> D[Continue or exit]
  C -- Yes --> E[Complete input]
  E --> F{Valid state?}
  F -- No --> G[Show local guidance]
  G --> E
  F -- Yes --> H[Confirm action]
  H --> I[Show outcome]
  I --> J[Offer next relevant action]
  B --> K[Open supporting detail]
  K --> L[Return to primary surface]